# Gate 4 - Type and Lint Escapes

`any`, `as unknown as`, `@ts-ignore`, `@ts-expect-error`, `eslint-disable` are
all one-line ways to make a red thing green.

Census each across `src/`, computed fresh by `check.cjs` every render.
Growing past the committed ceiling (`ceilings.json`) fails the gate; the
live list below shows exactly where each one is.

